      "title": "The Global \"afterEach\" Guard",
      "lectureOrder": 187,
      "videoOrder": 163,
      "sourceHash": "f517952665871f952ed2ce35f54b48852ad34d156a8823de2deff8e3bbd78430",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.46,
          "en": "Now, there is another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.46,
          "end": 7.06,
          "en": "global guard we can add on the router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.06,
          "end": 10.37,
          "en": "and that is the afterEach guard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.37,
          "end": 12.69,
          "en": "This also wants a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.69,
          "end": 14.09,
          "en": "and of course, as always here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.09,
          "end": 16.66,
          "en": "it doesn't matter how you define the function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.66,
          "end": 19.08,
          "en": "if you do it like this or as an arrow function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.08,
          "end": 21.98,
          "en": "and this also it gets the to and from argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.98,
          "end": 26.49,
          "en": "but not the next function because afterEach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.49,
          "end": 30.353,
          "en": "will only run once a navigation has been confirmed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.46,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "So in here, you can't change that anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 37.11,
          "en": "You can't deny a navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.11,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "You can only do this in the before hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 41.86,
          "en": "in the before guards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.86,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "The afterEach guard could be nice for sending analytics data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 48.74,
          "en": "to your own server, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.74,
          "end": 51.01,
          "en": "to log every navigation action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.01,
          "end": 53.65,
          "en": "and log when a user changes pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.65,
          "end": 55.793,
          "en": "That's something you could do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.64,
          "end": 59.79,
          "en": "You don't use it to control what the user sees",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.79,
          "end": 63.31,
          "en": "on the screen because as I just said, it's too late here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.31,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "You can just console.log to and from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "or send data to your server, as I said, but that's about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 74.983,
          "en": "So here, I will console.log Global afterEach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.82,
          "end": 78.55,
          "en": "And if I do that and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.55,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "we see if I load that, Global afterEach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 85.10300000000001,
          "en": "is the last thing we see on every navigation action.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
